<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<title>Call Sheet</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Libre+Franklin:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    /* Palette drawn from two reference frames: Empire Strikes Back's cockpit
       warmth (the coral accent, the cream) and Birdman's backstage teal-navy
       (the ground, the dusty-rose secondary). */
    --bg: #10161c;
    --surface: #171f27;
    --surface-2: #1e2831;
    --surface-3: #26313c;
    --border: #2c3742;
    --text: #ece5da;
    --text-dim: #9aa7b0;
    --text-faint: #59666f;
    --accent: #e2664c;
    --accent-dim: #5c2e22;
    --accent-2: #b98a97;
    --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;
    --sans: 'Libre Franklin', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  ::selection { background: var(--accent-dim); color: var(--text); }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  header.hero {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 4rem 0 3.5rem;
  }

  /* --- hero image band --- */
  .hero-band {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .hero-band .bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 38%;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .hero-band .scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16,22,28,0.30) 0%, rgba(16,22,28,0.90) 74%, var(--bg) 100%);
  }

  .hero-band header.hero {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    border-bottom: none;
    padding: 4.75rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-caption {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .watch-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-dim);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .watch-link:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--text-dim); }
  .watch-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .watch-link .play {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* --- proof section: quote + screenshot --- */
  .proof-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .proof-grid .proof {
    margin-top: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .screenshot-frame {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .screenshot-frame .chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .screenshot-frame .chrome span {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--surface-3);
  }

  .screenshot-frame .chrome label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
  }

  .screenshot-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* --- filmstrip --- */
  .filmstrip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .filmstrip { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .filmstrip .still:last-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }

  .filmstrip .still {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .filmstrip .still img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .filmstrip .still .cap {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(16,22,28,0.85), transparent);
  }

  /* --- roadmap --- */
  .roadmap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--border);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .roadmap { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 460px) {
    .roadmap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .roadmap .q {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 1.4rem 1.2rem;
  }

  .roadmap .q .qnum {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .roadmap .q h3 {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .roadmap .q p {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* --- budget --- */
  .budget-note {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .budget-table {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .budget-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .budget-row:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

  .budget-row .label {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .budget-row .label strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .budget-row .label span {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .budget-row .amount {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .budget-row.total {
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .budget-row.total .label strong,
  .budget-row.total .amount {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  /* --- about --- */
  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 2.25rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-layout .headshot { width: 140px; }
  }

  .about-layout .headshot {
    width: 180px;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    filter: grayscale(0.15);
  }

  .about-layout .about-text .dim { margin-top: 0; }
  .about-layout .about-text .dim + .dim { margin-top: 1rem; }

  .credits-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
  }

  .credits-list span::before {
    content: "\2022";
    margin-right: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .credits-list span:first-child::before { content: none; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }

  .status-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .badge {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .status-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .cta-row {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .pitch-card {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .pitch-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-dim); }
  .pitch-card:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .pitch-card img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .pitch-card .play-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(16,22,28,0.55);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .pitch-card:hover .play-badge {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.06);
  }

  .pitch-card .caption {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .pitch-card .caption strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  section {
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

  .section-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .section-label::after {
    content: "";
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--text); max-width: 68ch; }
  p.dim { color: var(--text-dim); }
  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card .num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .proof {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .proof-quote {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .credit-line {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .credit-line span::before {
    content: "\2022";
    margin-right: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .credit-line span:first-child::before { content: none; }

  footer {
    padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .contact h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .links a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .links a:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .links a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .film-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    max-width: 32ch;
    text-align: right;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    footer { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .film-tag { text-align: left; }
  }

  /* --- site nav --- */
  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  }

  section[id], #proof { scroll-margin-top: 4.25rem; }

  .sitenav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(23, 31, 39, 0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }

  .sitenav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  .sitenav button {
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .sitenav .brand {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text);
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sitenav .brand:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .sitenav .navlinks {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.35rem;
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .sitenav .navlink {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .sitenav .navlink:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent-dim); }
  .sitenav .navlink:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="sitenav">
  <button type="button" class="brand" data-target="top">CALL_SHEET</button>
  <div class="navlinks">
    <button type="button" class="navlink" data-target="problem">Problem</button>
    <button type="button" class="navlink" data-target="features">Features</button>
    <button type="button" class="navlink" data-target="proof">Proof</button>
    <button type="button" class="navlink" data-target="film">Film</button>
    <button type="button" class="navlink" data-target="next">Roadmap</button>
    <button type="button" class="navlink" data-target="budget">Budget</button>
    <button type="button" class="navlink" data-target="about">About</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="hero-band" id="top">
  <div class="bg"></div>
  <div class="scrim"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Open source &middot; Unreal Engine</p>
      <h1>Call Sheet</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Batches Unreal's markerless mocap pipeline, start to finish. Drop your footage in, get retargeted MetaHuman takes out, no clicking through every one by hand.</p>
      <div class="status-row">
        <span class="badge">Prototype</span>
        <span class="status-note">Built solo, already running in real production</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="pitch-card" href="https://youtu.be/365cCeomeG0" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Watch the Call Sheet pitch video">
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Title card for the Call Sheet pitch, Do You Copy" />
          <span class="play-badge">&#9654;</span>
          <span class="caption"><strong>Watch the pitch</strong> &middot; Call Sheet &amp; Do You Copy</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <p class="hero-caption">
      <span>Sc001/Sh00001 &mdash; "Do You Copy?," the production Call Sheet is built and tested against.</span>
      <a class="watch-link" href="https://youtu.be/APwutm59XRw?si=yVaHb8v8V272H9jD" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="play">&#9654;</span> Watch the Location Scout</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <section id="problem">
    <p class="section-label">The problem</p>
    <h2>Unreal's markerless mocap pipeline has no batching</h2>
    <p class="dim">MetaHuman Animator handles one single take at a time. Every clip means, after importing via Live Link/Capture Manager, manually adding it and processing it through MetaHuman Animator. Fine for a couple of hero shots. Painful for a real shoot day with a hundred takes to get through afterward.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="features">
    <p class="section-label">What it does</p>
    <h2>Already built, already running</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h3>Drop footage straight in</h3>
        <p>No manual import step first. Point it at a folder of markerless mocap footage and it takes it from there.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h3>Naming, handled</h3>
        <p>On import, it flags a shot/take naming mistake and shows you the suggested fix before anything actually gets renamed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h3>Character manager</h3>
        <p>Add your MetaHuman to Call Sheet's character list, then set face, body, and foot-lock, per take or as a blanket for the whole batch, all from inside Call Sheet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <h3>Unattended batching</h3>
        <p>Every take runs through MetaHuman Animator on its own. No standing over it clicking process, one take at a time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="proof">
    <p class="section-label">Proof, not a pitch</p>
    <h2>Built on a real production</h2>
    <div class="proof-grid">
      <div class="proof">
        <p class="proof-quote">Call Sheet is built and tested against real mocap takes from "Do You Copy?," not developed in the abstract.</p>
        <p class="dim">The panel alongside is Call Sheet actually batching takes from the film's shoot, real footage, not a staged demo. That's where its real pitfalls get found and fixed, not just anticipated.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="screenshot-frame">
        <div class="chrome"><span></span><span></span><span></span><label>Call Sheet &mdash; DoYouCopy batch</label></div>
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Call Sheet's batch panel inside Unreal Engine, processing takes from the DoYouCopy project" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="filmstrip">
      <div class="still">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Pavel, MetaHuman character built for Do You Copy?" />
        <p class="cap">Pavel</p>
      </div>
      <div class="still">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Kat, MetaHuman character built for Do You Copy?" />
